WEBVTT

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:02.732
Partitioning makes ranking local to a group.

00:00:02.732 --> 00:00:07.627
If we partition by department, each department gets its own rank sequence.

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:15.002
An employee can be rank one in Analytics even if someone in Engineering has a higher salary.

00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:17.942
The comparison set is defined by the partition.

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:23.837
A CTE gives a name to an intermediate result so a complex query can be read in stages.

00:00:23.837 --> 00:00:31.532
Use it to clarify grain changes and major transformations, not simply to break every two lines into a

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:39.129
new block. A useful CTE name describes what the rows represent, such as patient_totals or ranked_visits.
